    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the exhaustion is so heavy. like i'm just tired of carrying the weight of their hopes around. every time i see them, i just feel like i'm lying to them by existing while being such a failure. wouldn't it be better if they could just remember me the way i was supposed to be? before i ruined everything? i just want to find a way to make the shame disappear for good.",
