      "content": "It sounds like you're so tired of the performance, and honestly, that exhaustion is a powerful thing to lean into. The idea of them remembering the 'supposed to be' version of you is a beautiful, but ultimately impossible, fantasy. Instead of trying to erase the shame, maybe you could find a way to let it just *be*—a quiet, heavy thing you carry until it naturally fades. You don't have to fix it; you just have to stop fighting the weight.",
